    "body": "This likely doesn't work the way you think it does. This is always going to match, shadowing whatever value `_choose_style` had previously. The `_ => None` arm after this will never be matched.\r\n\r\nHere is one way to rewrite it, though I don't think it's optimal:\r\n\r\n```\r\nmatch variable {\r\n  \"ssh_style\" if ssh_connection.is_some() => Some(Ok(config.ssh_style)),\r\n  \"ssh_style\" if ssh_connection.is_none() => Some(Ok(config.style)),\r\n  \"style\" => Some(Ok(config.style)),\r\n  _ => None,\r\n}\r\n```",
    "created_at": "2021-12-29T06:48:01Z",
